  "_readme": "AI crawler user agents and what each one is doing. `match` is a case-insensitive substring of the User-Agent header. Order matters: more specific tokens (Claude-SearchBot, Claude-User) come before the vendor's training crawler. `tier`: training = copies pages into a training corpus (never produces a receipt); retrieval = builds the search index an AI answer engine looks things up in; user = fetched because a person asked an assistant something right now. Edit freely; send a PR when a vendor adds or renames a bot.",
